  "description": "Wangkhei  Phee is a textile fabric made of white cotton. It is a product which is protected under the GI registration and is made throughout  the Indian state of Manipur and is woven by women. The fabric is transparent, has many designs on its body, and is popularly worn by women of Manipur for marriage ceremonies and other festive occasions.",
